cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "dlink-x1852e-romfile: D-Link DSL-X1852E romfile.cfg decryptor and firmware unpacker"
message: "If you use this tool or its format writeup in your research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: back1ply
repository-code: "https://github.com/back1ply/dlink-x1852e-romfile"
url: "https://github.com/back1ply/dlink-x1852e-romfile"
abstract: >-
  First public tool and format writeup for the D-Link DSL-X1852E VDSL/ADSL
  modem-router (EG region firmware). Decrypts, inspects and re-packs the device's
  AES-128-CBC-encrypted romfile.cfg configuration backup using a key recovered from
  the firmware, and documents and unpacks the EG firmware container (RSA-2048
  signature + 2RDH + LZMA + SquashFS).
keywords:
  - d-link
  - dsl-x1852e
  - romfile
  - trendchip
  - airoha
  - firmware
  - reverse-engineering
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
